OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming
OL,6,Fcloudy overnight with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain or showers at first near the
OL,8,Fcoast. These will spread inland to
OL,9,Freach all areas from midnight. Less
OL,10,Fcold than last night. Light winds but
OL,11,Fbreezy along the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FRather cloudy with spells of
OL,14,Flight rain or drizzle, especially
OL,15,Fthrough the morning. Likely becoming
OL,16,Fdrier through the afternoon, but
OL,17,Ffurther rain overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
