OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOften
OL,6,Fcloudy with a chance of patchy rain on
OL,7,FTuesday and Wednesday, but also some
OL,8,Fdrier periods, especially on Thursday.
OL,9,FWindy near the coast. Temperatures
OL,10,Fgenerally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
